(vector (map (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "each cloud-itonami itonami game (public/games/itonami/<slug>/) gets its\n    own Ed25519 did:key CACAO actor identity, not one shared account" "keys are Worker-custodial (Level A per ADR-2607032300), NOT minted\n    out-of-band per game -- addendum revises the original per-game\n    cacao/mint + N Worker secrets design to instead reuse app-aozora's own\n    aozora.pds.actorkey HKDF derivation (operator master + game-did ->\n    per-game Ed25519 key), one master secret not N" "backend/ Worker gains POST /api/itonami/publish: derives the requesting\n    game's key via that HKDF scheme, signs a com.atproto.repo.createRecord\n    commit into THAT GAME'S OWN per-actor graph (canonical-graph(game-did,\n    db) per ADR-2607032300), never a shared/operator graph" "new lexicon network.isekai.session (extends the declared-but-unemitted\n    network.isekai.asset precedent, ADR-0008 §5) for in-game events: round\n    cleared, fork, urgent-bonus catch" "publish is Governor-gated the same containment shape as\n    com-etzhayyim-tashikame/kouhou (ADR-2607022200/2607022210): game client\n    proposes, a lightweight rule (not an LLM) approves/denies, every\n    publish/deny appended to an audit trail" "rollout: wire one game (plumbing-rounds) end-to-end first, then extend\n    the same wiring to the remaining games mechanically" "migration path to self-sovereign (Level B, actor's own key-backup signs\n    client-side) is the same one ADR-2607032300 defines for aozora's own\n    actors -- blocked on the same not-yet-built .cljc CACAO client-signing\n    port, not a separate itonami-specific blocker")), (:adr/supersedes (vector)), (:adr/superseded_by (vector)), (:adr/topic "itonami-games-atproto-actors-app-aozora"), (:adr/related (vector "adr-2607031000" "adr-2607022200" "adr-2607022210" "adr-2607032300" "adr-2607032400")), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607031400-itonami-games-atproto-actors-app-aozora"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/last_verified "2026-07-03"), (:adr/body "see 2607031400-itonami-games-atproto-actors-app-aozora.edn"), (:adr/deciders (vector "Jun Kawasaki")), (:adr/date "2026-07-03"), (:db/id -1), (:adr/authoritative true), (:adr/title "ADR-2607031400: itonami games as AT-Protocol actors — per-game Worker-held identity, posting to app-aozora"), (:adr/source-format "edn")))